    "sections": {
        "description": "A clean and flexible WordPress theme designed for travel agencies, tour operators, and travel bloggers. Built with Elementor, it provides ready-made homepage layouts, destination sections, and well-structured inner pages to help you create a professional travel website with ease. The theme is fully responsive, lightweight, and optimized for fast loading across all devices. It supports popular WordPress plugins and follows standard coding practices, making it easy to customize and extend. Whether you are showcasing travel packages, destinations, or travel stories, this theme helps you present your content in a clear and engaging way—without requiring any coding knowledge."
